#: ../../tools/chebi_tools.rst:32 f3f5f543a5ac4c8ea91a95f4e969cd8a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a chemical entity from "
"ChEBI (Chemical Entities of Biological Interest) by its CHEBI ID. Returns"
" the compound name, definition, synonyms, molecular formula, mass, "
"InChIKey, SMILES, charge, and star rating (curation quality: 3=manually "
"curated, 2=checked, 1=unchecked). ChEBI is maintained by EBI and is the "
"standard reference for small molecules in biology. Example: CHEBI:15365 "
"returns acetylsalicylic acid (aspirin)."
msgstr ""

